2... f6? { A really bad move. We now have a trap similar to the notorious Damiano Trap. } 3. fxe5 fxe5?? { Played 92% of the time. We win immediately now. } (3... Nc6 { The Soller-Zilbermints Gambit. } 4. Bb5 fxe5 (4... Nxe5 5. d4 Ng6 6. h4 $16) (4... Bc5 5. Bxc6 dxc6 6. Nc3 $16 { [%cal Bd2d3,Bg1f3] }) 5. Bxc6 dxc6 6. Qh5+ $16) 4. Qh5+ { Winning the e pawn and much more later on. } { [%csl Ge5,Ge8][%cal Gh5e5,Gh5e8] } 4... g6 { Opening the diagonal to the rook. } { [%csl Rh8] } (4... Ke7 5. Qxe5+ Kf7 6. Bc4+ { Giving checks. Forcing the king farther away from his camp. Mate will come very soon. } { [%csl Gf7][%cal Gc4f7] }) 5. Qxe5+ { Giving a check and winning the rook. } { [%csl Ge8,Gh8][%cal Ge5e8,Ge5h8] } 5... Qe7 6. Qxh8 $18 { White is completely winning. It's +9 :D } *


